            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Forty-seven percent of the 432 respondents to our online survey said they plan to vote for Clinton, and the exact same percentage said they intend to vote for Trump. Most respondents thought Trump would do a better job making the system more efficient. A clear majority said that Clinton would do better job limiting cost shifting to consumers.</AbstractText>
